A||||5||ChadMan||Quad 4 88 Coupe at autocross||||10||
Z||000000||ChadMan||07-28-2001||07:07 PM||||Had a spare couple of hours this afternoon, so I popped down to the autocross track to see who was running.  It was well worth the trip...Keith Napier (sp?) from Mansfield was running his yellow 88 Coupe that he converted to HO Quad 4 power.  It's lowered and running on race tires (didn't notice what brand) and he looked great out there.  He was running E Mod and said there were much faster cars in his class, but I didn't see any.<P>I'm really sorry I forgot my camera or I'd have pix to post.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>There were two other Fieros there, both stock (86 SE auto and an 85 SE 4-sp), but the stock classes were already done for the day when I got there.||||reg||10
Z||000001||2M4 Dale||07-28-2001||08:35 PM||||Keith's Quad 4 Coupe is awesome !!! He let me Autocross it last summer......GAWD is it fast !!! and GAWD does it handle !!! It was my first time out and I was beating the Corvette times. (I DNF'd my coupe...lol...the dog-gone little clip that keeps the coolant line together at the manifold broke and I spewed coolant all over the track) I haven't driven Keiths car since he lowered it. Can't wait ! Y'all can come and see it and maybe go for a ride in it at my Cookout / Campout in August.||||reg||1
Z||000002||87ECO5||07-29-2001||09:13 AM||||Hmmmm ... maybe Keith and I will have to put our cars on the line!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>OMG!!!!!  I'm starting to sound like BOILERMAKER!!!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  ha ha ha<P>Seriously though, I'm very excited about this campout.  I've been looking forward to it since August of last year!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
